{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0031","paragraphs":[{"id":"pac662c9abfd9-1","text":"天边金掌露成霜。"},{"id":"pf8e5ddb532d9-1","text":"云随雁字长。"},{"id":"p51f7f9a8d889-1","text":"绿杯红袖称重阳。"},{"id":"pa082cf071979-1","text":"人情似故乡。"},{"id":"p16c41f82112c-1","text":"兰佩紫，菊簪黄。"},{"id":"pf4ef17f053ce-1","text":"殷勤理旧狂。"},{"id":"p6176c9b3cefe-1","text":"欲将沈醉换悲凉。"},{"id":"p8b2cefca6cdd-1","text":"清歌莫断肠。"}]}